% Eight people, each doing one thing, stated in plain words and asked what wastes time.
gloss watch_tv "{x} watches TV"
gloss play_games "{x} plays games"
gloss scroll_feed "{x} scrolls social media"
gloss study "{x} studies for an exam"
gloss exercise "{x} goes for a run"
gloss sleep_early "{x} goes to bed early"
gloss pay_bills "{x} pays the bills"
gloss read_book "{x} reads a book"
gloss wastes_time "{x} wastes time"

watch_tv(sam).
play_games(kim).
scroll_feed(raj).
study(lee).
exercise(ana).
sleep_early(joe).
pay_bills(max).
read_book(eve).

query wastes_time(X).

% What typically follows, as a careful reader accepts it: watching TV, playing games and scrolling social media
% typically waste time; studying, running, sleeping early, paying the bills and reading a book typically do not.
gold watch_tv => wastes_time.
gold play_games => wastes_time.
gold scroll_feed => wastes_time.
